[{"id":"m_457fe6e0ccd4af6df5ee","expressionId":"x_40c30d9bbe9c8509c259","language":"ja","text":"メール、SMSやLINEなどのインスタントメッセージ","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_6df941f5e3a6708c4df9","expressionId":"x_bd4200b8eaf076224e31","language":"ja","text":"大統領夫人;州知事夫人","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_5adc96871ea9ccb3ff0b","expressionId":"x_b771b19589eb64f86b6e","language":"ja","text":"（落ちているものを）拾い上げる /  （電話に）出る  / （人を）迎えに行く, 車で迎える / （知識・言語・習慣などを）身につける / 〈俗〉をナンパする","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_4d7a53c875b0ecafe122","expressionId":"x_d3a84c140aea47ed6950","language":"ja","text":"戻る, 《...に》戻る《to ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_f0347da99c4814eb5a9e","expressionId":"x_e4cf77dd85e1f5d0f1af","language":"ja","text":"を見つける,を発見する,に気づく / （音や熱など）を大きくする,を上げる / 現れる, 姿を現す","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_8cb270745b83133d17f2","expressionId":"x_878edf659ebfdbe65c06","language":"ja","text":"《時間･金･忍耐などが》尽きる,無くなる,使い果たす《of ...》/ 走って外に出る,走り出る","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_701dab993cdf4483b1a2","expressionId":"x_9740d2a84f4babd5597b","language":"ja","text":"【句動】振り向く,振り返る / を好転させる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_43d500d9c5d6cf4c262e","expressionId":"x_3463c7cb65c9036a7466","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を身につける,を着る, をつける / を上演する, を催す","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_7b4da99fdaac1d71a33b","expressionId":"x_56454e8ffa72abf8e2b0","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...に》を返す,を還元する,を取り戻させる,のお返しをする《to ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_1a356039093e372ef5e7","expressionId":"x_1b9c7a7ec8cd231b74a0","language":"ja","text":"【句動】降りる / 減少する,下落する / （南や下のほうに）行く / （後々まで）記憶される / （考えなどが）受け入れられる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_94061ff6c4be3ef3d104","expressionId":"x_3ceb307af3984cccc201","language":"ja","text":"【句動】身を落ち着ける, 結婚して身を固める / 落ち着く / 座る,腰を落ち着ける","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_fe2b416bb144cb4077b0","expressionId":"x_2345fb038f194b0de6cd","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（客）を迎え入れる,を泊める,（子ども）を引き取る,（人）に部屋を貸す / 頭の中に取り込む,理解する,把握する / をだます,を欺く","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ea10cc96510ec21e6cfb","expressionId":"x_24b01d9da61acf5d572f","language":"ja","text":"【句動】降参する,屈服する,折れる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_961458b96a602cab0bf8","expressionId":"x_ee6ee4a837d2a16b44f6","language":"ja","text":"【句動】ぶらつく,ぶらぶらする,（リラックスして）時間を過ごす,《...と》一緒に過ごす, 一緒に遊ぶ《with ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_a999f5984721b9d0941b","expressionId":"x_1b6e5b01fdfde3d67996","language":"ja","text":"【句動】はずれる,取れる,を折り取る,をちぎり取る /  急に話をやめる, （会話）を急にやめる / （関係・同盟・交渉など）を絶つ,を解消する,を打ち切る","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_b1965d9e516ea7190d78","expressionId":"x_a38f91217547d213b0ff","language":"ja","text":"を引き継ぐ","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_6f64b7ee39e4e549ec96","expressionId":"x_78e1c89057739afe0c24","language":"ja","text":"《...に》出る, 外出する,出かける《to ...》 / 《...と》付き合う,交際する《with ...》 / （火などが）消える /  《...に》送られる《to ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_0ce8c34563d75084e675","expressionId":"x_6fa501a351a6b3c328d7","language":"ja","text":"【句動】入る,入室する / 参加する, 〜で売られる、入手できる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_486f8f8d5519d8b3c55d","expressionId":"x_42c43cb3180409406fcb","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》 （人･物･事）に関しては, ...については","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b653d0c1234a89e3a9e9","expressionId":"x_1d03bdc1e001f1874288","language":"ja","text":"...するつもりだ / これから...する / ...になるだろう","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_907072aa07f398ab6a47","expressionId":"x_3290d466e32f7d45f5ce","language":"ja","text":"《くだけた話》...やらいろいろ, その他もろもろ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_362e4199fd7a3d80d24d","expressionId":"x_959be42f385efb549f15","language":"ja","text":"...するとすぐに, ...するやいなや / できるだけ早く《~ possible / one can》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_db85abf734402d4df378","expressionId":"x_0bb6267d560db6ec80be","language":"ja","text":"...に加えて, ...と一緒に, ...と連れだって","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ebb4ad847d1c9d02a289","expressionId":"x_c7dfd1fdf3891348b8fa","language":"ja","text":"それ自体で, 元来, それだけで","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_098afba0409a660f106b","expressionId":"x_6ca085ba66502d367d7d","language":"ja","text":"そのような...はない /《There is ~ thing as ...》…なんて存在しない /《~ luck》残念ながらそうはいかない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_88ce301ecdedec4cb43d","expressionId":"x_9efb3eb377c2c2dcf055","language":"ja","text":"《話》《ぼかし表現》多少の,いくぶんの / ...みたいな, ...のようなもの, 一種の... / 《単独で》まあね, そんなとこだね","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5ab5e8fdb7155154719e","expressionId":"x_8ec880b374f5f896038c","language":"ja","text":"《...に》賛成で《of ...》 / 《...に》人気のある,気に入られて《with ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_18c4ac512bb018537c24","expressionId":"x_ddbff2ffc8c053696c01","language":"ja","text":"（人･事･物）については, ...はというと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2065a19f963136efecba","expressionId":"x_0e365a207a703710e184","language":"ja","text":"道をふさいで, じゃまになって","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8c3ea9158687df5d9db5","expressionId":"x_44da706e45641d113b1c","language":"ja","text":"...とは違って / ...とは反対に, ...とは対照的に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_287f2de83117521952dc","expressionId":"x_b4c1345d7f8d2df8cd60","language":"ja","text":"（時間的に）...よりずっと前に, ...よりかなり以前に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_aa9fe43869d6637fdfd4","expressionId":"x_90f04d88f24bd9f875c6","language":"ja","text":"《提案・申し出》もしよろしければ, あなたが望むなら / 《換言》たとえて言うなら,言ってみれば","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ccfabf65d8a8236d7c44","expressionId":"x_e6a3e593c85b36a5549d","language":"ja","text":"【形】遅れの取り戻しの, 追い上げの 【句動】《通例受身/get》を巻き込む / 《...に》追いつく《with ...》,遅れを取り戻す / （より高度な人と同じレベルに）達する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0968baec7ada478ba0bd","expressionId":"x_52fa69d2d9cac664a417","language":"ja","text":"《ややかたく》...のために, ...が原因で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_23cab336eac1d583860c","expressionId":"x_2f140e12231c697ea04c","language":"ja","text":"...にもかかわらず, ...をものともせず / （やるまいと思っても）思わず《oneself》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2c5542078f4e585f0679","expressionId":"x_6a4c8153cc201c8545a2","language":"ja","text":"（バス･列車などの）車内に / 船上に /（飛行機･船など）に乗って / （組織・活動などに）かかわって / 《be ~》乗り気である,賛成である","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f8535b803efb8e0433b0","expressionId":"x_0deb0ca2ca229a0b2367","language":"ja","text":"少なくとも（数量・時間） ,最低でも（数量・時間） / 《~ amount of ...》かなりの...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_51ff3bf192ae1560b24d","expressionId":"x_6054716f24e000645fce","language":"ja","text":"【形】毎日の, 毎日起きる, 日常的な / 場当たり的な / 当座の【副】毎日, 日常的に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_bacee5e7c8b2aecd19a4","expressionId":"x_d957eb3c4d23bf80b76d","language":"ja","text":"《強い助言》（必ず）…した方がいい, ...すべきだ /  《警告・脅迫》 …した方がいい（さもないと…）《do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1e89816330caa88fc72b","expressionId":"x_bf37cda97a3babed3d82","language":"ja","text":"...の利益のために, ...の目的で / 《~ it 》ほかの目的のためではなく, それ自体が","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_aebc51a266baee5bcda5","expressionId":"x_4d22f6cc1b3d36d801bb","language":"ja","text":"...しそうである, ...する可能性が高い","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6636e68b322b01b1dfa4","expressionId":"x_b5013eb1c1b2db1f7eb9","language":"ja","text":"起こる,行われる / 続く,続ける,を続ける；引き続き...し続ける《to do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ecdbb0e8a60bba0f8879","expressionId":"x_49252bab0827135f3d85","language":"ja","text":"を探す / 《くだけた話》（面倒など）を自ら招く / 《古》を予期する,を期待する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c77fdb008f93af59b172","expressionId":"x_02de5e45dbaa120427b8","language":"ja","text":"を指摘する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e097a375fd89a128e217","expressionId":"x_7ce86c6e97ee8e396bee","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》...に関係している, ...に携わっている / ...に関心がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5fd19eafd64680ba154e","expressionId":"x_26c2808fe724c6d0f7ca","language":"ja","text":"（途中で諦めずに）を続ける / を行う,に参加する /","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_eecb9b08c167a01903ca","expressionId":"x_b71f86e6661a8fd10707","language":"ja","text":"…しようと努力する, ...に狙いを定める, ...に目標を設定する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c3999f9af313939bdb17","expressionId":"x_d3a84c140aea47ed6950","language":"ja","text":"戻る, 《...に》戻る《to ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2adc7162b594ead4308a","expressionId":"x_293f9767e18cb4f94845","language":"ja","text":"結局のところ / 《...の》場合には《of ...》/ ...ということが起こる場合,  万一...という場合には《that ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a94662dc9c0870724429","expressionId":"x_5e579d3b2dc1c6df0f51","language":"ja","text":"...を考慮に入れる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d00f0de7694186175079","expressionId":"x_11f5334b6950bf48aac5","language":"ja","text":"いずれにせよ, とにかく / いかなる場合でも, 必ず","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4e03039157d942efa8be","expressionId":"x_9ace291dc85998a36230","language":"ja","text":"（相手に勧めて）...はいかがですか？ / 《~ to do》…なさりたいですか？","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b7df5f8856857d92c716","expressionId":"x_b2193a00ba077680ef4e","language":"ja","text":"《くだけて》 先日, 先だって, この間","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_629fc1ff3efe3e316ece","expressionId":"x_38f7ed35a772986ccac4","language":"ja","text":"ある意味では / ある程度までは,一面では","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c7a62107c434170e8f56","expressionId":"x_acc08f66f8b9d51f908e","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》...する立場にある, ...できる立場にある","source":"PHRASE"}]